From 0397dd1b4148ec74801a5ff6534349440eb09fc9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mike Kinney <mike.kinney@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 23 Nov 2026 16:22:05 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] fix(ui): keep machine assignment visible in Machines pane

Keep the assignment action outside the details scroll area and route
double-clicks through the existing undoable command with entry validation.
Explain when the selected machine has not been assigned to the setup.

Co-Authored-By: Codex <noreply@openai.com>

Fixes #3776
